# What Expo's build service (EAS) uploads for the KNU Field app.
#
# EAS uploads from the git root, which is the whole CRM. The app needs only
# mobile/ and the shared request/response definitions in src/lib/mobile-api,
# so everything else stays off Expo's servers. EAS does not honour a "/*"
# then "!/mobile/" pattern, so the rest is listed one by one. A new top-level
# folder in the CRM must be added here. This file replaces .gitignore for EAS
# uploads (docs.expo.dev/build-reference/easignore).

# The CRM, top level:
/.github
/.gitignore
/AGENTS.md
/CAREYOS_GC_PARTNERSHIPS_BUILD_SPECIFICATIONS.md
/CAREYOS_GC_PARTNERSHIPS_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md
/CAREYOS_GITHUB_INTELLIGENCE_ROADMAP.md
/CAREYOS_MOBILE_APP_PLAN.md
/CAREYOS_OPENCONSTRUCTIONERP_INTEGRATION_ANALYSIS.md
/CAREYOS_PERMIT_INTELLIGENCE_DESIGN.md
/CAREYOS_PLAN_TAKEOFF_STAGE1_DESIGN.md
/CLAUDE.md
/DISCOVERY.md
/MIGRATION_LOG.md
/MIGRATION_PLAN.md
/README.md
/components.json
/deploy.sh
/docs
/eslint.config.mjs
/next.config.ts
/package-lock.json
/package.json
/postcss.config.mjs
/prisma.config.ts
/prisma
/public
/scripts
/tsconfig.json
/vitest.config.ts
/vitest.setup.ts
/.env
